# state: any   (screen-driven (drive.py reads each screen); lane.savestate433)
# Forza Motorsport (4D53006E), lane.frametrace (#433): lane.gpuclock's
# forza-gpuclock route (forza.drive.route with `mark` in place of `find`).
# drive.py drives the race for the whole window (RT held) and writes
# `mark gameplay` at 6 s of confirmed play, so the scored window is the race.
# 400 s keeps the run under the Thor's 480 s cap.
drive forza 400 mark
